==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Onix|105}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Onix|109}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
**Both this card and the Lost Thunder print have the '''Land Crush''' attack, which first appeared as '''Fissure''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Golem|20}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

